('ORGDOC!ADM','ADM',null,'OPS','Incumbents exist','Moved from the HR chair. Branches are operational units, so facilities follow the network.'),
('ORGDOC!CCM','CCM',null,'OPS','Vrunda Potadar — interim','Reports to the Operations Head so that Regional and Branch Managers answer to one function for both delivery and collection. Finance retains credit limits, the AR ledger, receipt allocation and independent DSO measurement, so Operations cannot mark its own collection homework. Branch collection executives report to their Branch Manager on a solid line and to this chair on a dotted line for target, method and reporting. Dual chair with Bids and Tenders: bid pricing goes to the MD, and the Finance Head signs any credit decision for a client whose bid she prepared.'),
