('ORGDOC!INT','INT',null,'LND','Cohort · count varies','Owned by Learning & Development at head office, deployed to whichever branch or function sponsors the project. Central ownership keeps selection, stipend, evaluation and conversion consistent; the host chair supervises daily.'),
('ORGDOC!HRE','HRE',null,'HRH','Arti Sonawane','Titled HR Assistant in the KRA and Senior HR in the structure. Reconcile. Payroll is prepared and verified in the same chair — Accounts provides the independent check until an HR Manager exists.'),
